/Alt (Panel A shows a scatter plot with linear fits comparing log qe versus log Ce for two materials, MAB \(red circles\) and MPB \(blue squares\), with equation and R squared values labeled. Panel B presents a linear plot of Ce/qe versus Ce for MAB and MPB, with distinct fit lines and equations, indicating adsorption model fits. Panel C displays an adsorption isotherm comparing qe versus Ce for both materials; data points are shown with fitted Sips model curves, and R squared values are presented for both data sets.)
